WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.313
Lab 1 is in the developer workbook's
Chapter 3, on a laptop with no tenant.

2
00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:08.215
You render the morning
of November sixteenth,

3
00:00:08.215 --> 00:00:13.105
when the Entra diagnostic setting stopped
overnight and the probe didn't run:

4
00:00:13.105 --> 00:00:18.224
four telemetry rows flagged, and sync,
risk, emergency access and grants all stale.

5
00:00:18.224 --> 00:00:22.050
Then you render the next morning and
see what the empty queues were hiding.

6
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:26.500
And when you try to record the first
render as evidence, the kit refuses.
